  "description": "Furvana is a \"furry fandom and anthropomorphic arts convention\" in Ocean Shores, Washington, organized by Furvana LLP, a partnership founded in June 2018 by Fritzy Wolf, who co-chairs it with Metal Fox. The first Furvana was held September 27 to 29, 2019, at the Ocean Shores Convention Center. The group has also run a field day in Everett, hosted a RAIn winter holiday party and marched in the Seattle Pride Parade. Attendance has grown from 452 in 2019 to about 1,200 in 2025.",
